        {
            "id": "7",
            "cell_type": "markdown",
            "metadata": {
            },
            "source": [
                "\n",
                "The resulting basis gives a sequential identification of the parameters from equations 5, 10, 4, 2. We can write equivalently\n",
                "\n",
                "$$ \n",
                "\\begin{matrix}\n",
                "w[1] =  s[1, 1] \\\\ \n",
                "l[1, 2] =  s[1, 2] / s[1, 1] \\\\ \n",
                "w[2] = (s[1, 1]*s[2, 2] - s[1, 2]^2 ) / s[1, 1]  \\\\\n",
                "l[2, 3] = s[2, 3] / s[2, 2]\\\\ \n",
                "w[3] = (s[2, 2]*s[3, 3] -  s[2, 3]^2) / s[2, 2]\n",
                "\\end{matrix}\n",
                "$$\n",
                "\n",
                "#### Open points\n",
